{
  "Name": "Okta - Admin & Configuration Changes - Okta Policy Modified, Deactivated or Deleted",
  "Description": "Alert: Alert - Okta - Admin & Configuration Changes\nMITRE ATT&CK: Defense Evasion / T1562\nSchedule: every 15 minutes over the previous 15 minutes (edit the scheduled search to change it)\nTuning: okta_user_allowlist / okta_ip_allowlist keys \"<login without domain>|Okta Policy Modified, Deactivated or Deleted\" or \"<ip>|Okta Policy Modified, Deactivated or Deleted\"\n\nDetects Okta policies being modified, deactivated or deleted (policy.lifecycle.update / deactivate / delete). Weakening sign-on, password or MFA policy is a common way to lower defenses. Merges the separate modify, deactivate and delete rules.\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/sigmahq/sigma/identity/okta/okta_policy_modified_or_deleted/\n- https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/identity/okta/?query=okta.yml",
  "GUID": "9ba1da25-cd69-5a49-93a2-b34636093174",
